      "content": "Wait, sorry—what do you mean by goblins? I'm trying to study for a medical board exam, not a fantasy novel. The goblin thing is actually really confusing and isn't helping me at all. Can you please just stop the metaphors and give me the actual biochemical steps? I need the clinical, professional explanation for the USMLE.",
